Z||000000||stimpy||04-14-2000||11:24 PM||||DISCLAIMER AND WARNING&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; THIS THREAD DOES CONTAIN SOME PISSING AND MOANING BY THE THREADS ORIGINATOR, ME, STIMPY. I WROTE IT IN A BAD MOOD AND WOULD JUST AS SOON DELETE IT.  IF YOU ARE OFFENDED BY CONTROVERSIAL DISCUSSIONS OR JUST PLAIN CAN'T STAND WHINY PEOPLE LIKE ME, PLEASE HIT THE BACK BUTTON ON YOUR BROWSER. THANK YOU FOR YOUR PATIENCE.<P>What do we need to do to move on? This whole debate on "Streetracing" that my name has gotten sucked into is drivingme to the edge. Can I just clarify something? I DON"T STREETRACE!!! Sure, I participate in a little stop-light shennanigans, but only up to speed limit or what safe conditions allow. I have never posted any threads braggng of my conquests. I have never used the words "nice kill, man!" I have never encouraged goading inexperienced drivers to double the speed limit on dark rainy nights. I have never condoned the same. <P>I made the mistake of using a lighthearted tone to chastise someone who did relate such an event instead of stepping up and ripping the head off of said individual and defecating down said individual's said neck! <P>Believe me, I have learned my lesson. Now as far as this thread deleting thing goes, please leave me out of it. I am so tired. I am really getting confused as to whom I offended and whom I defended. My wish was to do neither to anyone.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by stimpy (edited 04-15-2000).]||||reg||9
